Contains patterns adapted from six2dez/dispatch
(https://github.com/six2dez/dispatch), MIT License, Copyright (c) six2dez:

- manifest.json structure and plugin packaging layout (manifest at zip root,
  frontend/backend entrypoints under dist/)
- backend: request-field extraction (sdk.requests.get(...) accessor usage) and
  child-process spawning via login shell from the plugin backend runtime
- frontend: context extraction (request / requests arrays) and menu/command
  registration calls; sdk/vite dependency versions

Adapted and reduced to the single "SEPP: send to Hunt" use case; dispatch
itself is inspired by PortSwigger's custom-send-to. MIT text: see the
dispatch upstream repository LICENSE.
